  "title": "Smooth vs Analytic.",
  "body": " Smooth vs Analytic  You will find that some authors define Lie groups as analytic manifolds (e.g. Serre). While it might seem this is a stronger condition than being smooth, in fact, every smooth Lie group admits a unique analytic structure compatible with the smooth structure.  "
